  "info.iuce.button": "About this machine",
  "info.iuce.macerator.title": "Macerator",
  "info.iuce.macerator.1": "Crushes ore into 2 crushed dusts (3 from deepslate ore), the first step of ore multiplication.",
  "info.iuce.macerator.2": "Crushed dust can be smelted directly, but washing it first yields extra nuggets.",
  "info.iuce.macerator.3": "Also grinds coal, diamonds and copper ingots into dust for alloys and energy materials.",
  "info.iuce.macerator.4": "Voltage tier: LV (32 EU/t). Accepts overclocker, ejector and other upgrades.",
  "info.iuce.compressor.title": "Compressor",
  "info.iuce.compressor.1": "Densifies only: 9 plates → dense plate, 8 coal dust → coal ball,",
  "info.iuce.compressor.2": "8 coal balls → compressed coal ball → diamond, 9 energium dust → energy crystal.",
  "info.iuce.compressor.3": "Use the Metal Former for plates, rods and wires.",
  "info.iuce.compressor.4": "Voltage tier: LV (32 EU/t). Accepts overclocker, ejector and other upgrades.",
  "info.iuce.metal_former.title": "Metal Former",
  "info.iuce.metal_former.1": "Three modes (click the button right of the arrow):",
  "info.iuce.metal_former.2": "Rolling: ingot → plate 1:1 (the forge hammer needs 2 ingots);",
  "info.iuce.metal_former.3": "Cutting: plate → 4 wires (the cutter makes only 2);",
  "info.iuce.metal_former.4": "Extruding: ingot → 2 rods (the forge hammer makes only 1).",
  "info.iuce.metal_former.5": "Voltage tier: LV (32 EU/t). Accepts overclocker, ejector and other upgrades.",
  "info.iuce.extractor.title": "Extractor",
  "info.iuce.extractor.1": "Extracts 3 rubber from raw latex (a furnace makes only 1),",
  "info.iuce.extractor.2": "and gets latex out of rubber wood and rubber leaves.",
  "info.iuce.extractor.3": "Voltage tier: LV (32 EU/t). Accepts overclocker, ejector and other upgrades.",
  "info.iuce.electric_furnace.title": "Electric Furnace",
  "info.iuce.electric_furnace.1": "A furnace driven by electricity; runs every vanilla smelting recipe.",
  "info.iuce.electric_furnace.2": "Smelting purified dust also yields 3 nuggets; crushed dust and ore get no bonus.",
  "info.iuce.electric_furnace.3": "Next to an Induction Furnace: +50%% speed and +1 parallel each, and it may borrow their energy.",
  "info.iuce.electric_furnace.4": "Voltage tier: LV (32 EU/t).",
  "info.iuce.ore_washer.title": "Ore Washer",
  "info.iuce.ore_washer.1": "Uses 1000 mB of water to wash crushed dust into purified dust, with a 50%% chance of a by-product nugget",
  "info.iuce.ore_washer.2": "(tin → zinc, lead → silver, uranium → lead: the ore chains feed each other).",
  "info.iuce.ore_washer.3": "Fill it by hand with water buckets, or automatically with a Pump and a Fluid Pulling Upgrade.",
  "info.iuce.ore_washer.4": "Voltage tier: LV (32 EU/t).",
  "info.iuce.electrolyzer.title": "Electrolyzer",
  "info.iuce.electrolyzer.1": "MV electrochemistry; every operation uses 1000 mB of water:",
  "info.iuce.electrolyzer.2": "machine casing → plated casing, diamond dust → energium dust (the only source),",
  "info.iuce.electrolyzer.3": "clay → aluminium dust, glowstone dust → redstone + gold nugget.",
  "info.iuce.electrolyzer.4": "Draws water from an adjacent Pump. Voltage tier: MV (128 EU/t).",
  "info.iuce.induction_furnace.title": "Induction Furnace",
  "info.iuce.induction_furnace.1": "MV alloy furnace: the only source of bronze, brass, steel, refined steel and magnets.",
  "info.iuce.induction_furnace.2": "Ingot route 3+1 → 3; dust route (fed by macerator and washer) 3+1 → 4.",
  "info.iuce.induction_furnace.3": "Steel needs 4 iron ingots + 1 coal ball (made in the Compressor).",
